          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: East-to-west (E-W) observation of a very bright white phenomenon with a red mark in front; sudden extinction in a clear sky: observation of a meteoroid re-entry.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "2143e52e70257a3aae26168bd2c1c130c44d3ee28d8976eae1f818175f4a9bff"
